<view class="page page-with-nav">
  <view class="ad-head">
    <view class="ad-head__title">管理员工作台</view>
    <view class="ad-head__sub" wx:if="{{generatedAt}}">数据更新于 {{generatedAt}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="loading-wrap" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>

  <block wx:if="{{!loading}}">
    <view class="card" wx:if="{{stats}}">
      <view class="stat-grid">
        <view class="stat">
          <view class="stat__value">{{stats.teacherCount || 0}}</view>
          <view class="stat__label">教师</view>
        </view>
        <view class="stat">
          <view class="stat__value">{{stats.studentCount || 0}}</view>
          <view class="stat__label">学生</view>
        </view>
        <view class="stat">
          <view class="stat__value">{{stats.parentCount || 0}}</view>
          <view class="stat__label">家长</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block mt-24" bindtap="goAccounts">账号管理</button>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text class="card-title__text">班级管理</text>
      </view>
      <view class="text-sm text-muted">
        创建班级并绑定教师、学生与家长。教师仅能管理自己所在的班级，学生与家长的提交会归入该班级的负责教师。
      </view>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block mt-24" bindtap="goClasses">创建班级</button>
    </view>

  </block>
</view>

<nav-bar role="admin" active="overview" />
